#: ../../../developer/releases/4_0/release-notes.rst:10
#: c2190379610b464c9517d6c9e1145fde
msgid ""
"Core management scripts rewrite with better structure and extensibility, "
"`current API documentation <https://dev.qubes-os.org/projects/core-admin/en/"
"latest/>`__ and the documentation API index as a `webarchive <https://"
"web.archive.org/web/20230128102821/https://dev.qubes-os.org/projects/qubes-"
"core-admin/en/latest/>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/releases/4_0/release-notes.rst:12
#: 82e9b275f7584b93997e9e8410371c21
msgid ""
"`Admin API <https://www.qubes-os.org/news/2017/06/27/qubes-admin-api/>`__ "
"allowing strictly controlled managing from non-dom0"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/releases/4_0/release-notes.rst:14
#: f47caf234986431a876ac1c8160c7e32
msgid "All ``qvm-*`` command-line tools rewritten, some options have changed"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/releases/4_0/release-notes.rst:16
#: 2f4b3eb2d2294389bcbe6429fb055bb2
msgid ""
"Renaming VM directly is prohibited, there is GUI to clone under new name and "
"remove old VM"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/releases/4_0/release-notes.rst:18
#: c2fc94cbbd8745a19fdc83d73620bbe0
msgid ""
"Use `PVH <https://github.com/QubesOS/qubes-secpack/blob/master/QSBs/"
"qsb-037-2018.txt>`__ and `HVM <https://github.com/QubesOS/qubes-issues/"
"issues/2185>`__ by default to `mitigate Meltdown & Spectre <https://"
"github.com/QubesOS/qubes-secpack/blob/master/QSBs/qsb-037-2018.txt>`__ and "
"lower the `attack surface on Xen <https://github.com/QubesOS/qubes-secpack/"
"blob/master/QSBs/qsb-024-2016.txt>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/releases/4_0/release-notes.rst:20
#: 15f3d6d3c875435e8b38e122ba09f2a7
msgid "Create USB VM by default"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/releases/4_0/release-notes.rst:22
#: 624cf3a9711e4387b436712e220052ea
msgid ""
"`Multiple DisposableVMs templates support <https://github.com/QubesOS/qubes-"
"issues/issues/2253>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/releases/4_0/release-notes.rst:24
#: 0d6f548ae7ac4b0f88735e74e7f77ae6
msgid ""
"New :doc:`backup format </user/how-to-guides/backup-emergency-restore-v4>` "
"using scrypt key-derivation function"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/releases/4_0/release-notes.rst:26
#: dd7e42b83f004f0787fc3ac61284a769
msgid "Non-encrypted backups no longer supported"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/releases/4_0/release-notes.rst:28
#: 85854606f37c4d6db5f732d5916715d8
msgid ""
"`split VM packages <https://github.com/QubesOS/qubes-issues/issues/2771>`__, "
"for better support minimal, specialized templates"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/releases/4_0/release-notes.rst:30
#: 2f4403f68aa1454aa980ee4fe4cf6d1a
msgid ""
"`Qubes Manager decomposition <https://github.com/QubesOS/qubes-issues/issues/"
"2132>`__ - domains and devices widgets instead of full Qubes Manager; "
"devices widget support also USB"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/releases/4_0/release-notes.rst:32
#: dc82ddf977b44789858108290804a45e
msgid ""
":doc:`More flexible firewall interface </developer/debugging/vm-interface>` "
"for ease unikernel integration"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/releases/4_0/release-notes.rst:34
#: b835ad91985b4a198397719bc3d447e8
msgid ""
"Template VMs do not have network interface by default, `qrexec-based updates "
"proxy <https://github.com/QubesOS/qubes-issues/issues/1854>`__ is used "
"instead"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/releases/4_0/release-notes.rst:36
#: a36aae0c79324eb2a45ae4213e1d2b65
msgid ""
"More flexible IP addressing for VMs - `custom IP <https://github.com/QubesOS/"
"qubes-issues/issues/1477>`__, `hidden from the IP <https://github.com/"
"QubesOS/qubes-issues/issues/1143>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/releases/4_0/release-notes.rst:38
#: 88406dcea7014ea3a9468efc69750332
msgid ""
"More flexible Qubes RPC policy - `related ticket <https://github.com/QubesOS/"
"qubes-issues/issues/865>`__, :ref:`documentation <developer/services/"
"qrexec:specifying vms: tags, types, targets, etc.>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/releases/4_0/release-notes.rst:40
#: 6da96636bab04219a423bf31d4fcc7de
msgid ""
"`New Qubes RPC confirmation window <https://github.com/QubesOS/qubes-issues/"
"issues/910>`__, including option to specify destination VM"
msgstr ""

